  "Qty 64 as published (no section counts are given). The list has no Objective; the 'Starting' section (Throne Room, Your Destiny, Insignificant Rebellion, the starting Interrupt, Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points, Oppressive Enforcement) counts toward the total. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'Heading For the medical frigate' under Starting is the Light starting Interrupt; on this Dark list it is dested to the Dark equivalent Prepared Defenses.",
  "Posted 'Throne Room' dested Death Star II: Throne Room; 'Choke Vader' Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith (the Special Edition Vader who 'chokes'); 'EPP Vader' Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Iggy With gun' IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Zuckus/Bossk/boba/dengar in ship' the pilot-in-ship starships; 'Dreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'Decree' Imperial Decree; 'Cantina' Tatooine: Cantina; 'endor docking bay' Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay); Hoth sites dested the marker pages.",
  "Secret Plans, Oppressive Enforcement and Come Here You Big Coward are the Special Edition Effects in 2000 (not the Reflections III Defensive Shields). Plain 'Executor' dested Executor (Dagobah)."
